WEBVTT

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:07.980
<i>Kain the Shirushigami, who one 
day appeared before Rinne.</i>

00:00:08.930 --> 00:00:10.340
Rokudou Rinne.

00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:14.500
You have a debt so large you couldn't 
possibly pay it back in your lifetime.

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:18.830
My scythe!

00:00:20.490 --> 00:00:27.250
<i>He has taken Rinne's Life Flame and 
Haori of the Underworld as collateral.</i>

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:28.480
Rokudou-kun.

00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:29.460
Rinne!

00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:32.490
He's not breathing.

00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:37.890
If you want it back, go 
find Damashigami Company.

00:00:38.360 --> 00:00:41.280
Find it by tomorrow morning at ten.

00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:42.730
Ten in the morning?!

00:00:43.470 --> 00:00:46.480
That's when the Afterlife 
recycle shop opens.

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:50.370
That's when I'll sell the Haori of the 
Underworld along with his Life Flame.

00:00:51.460 --> 00:00:56.590
Rokudou Rinne's life will expire the 
moment the shop takes ownership.

00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:03.860
<i>If they can't take it back, 
Rokudou Rinne will die.</i>

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:09.460
It seems you can't resist the 
power of the Rinne no Wa.

00:01:10.050 --> 00:01:14.090
I'll force you into the Rinne 
no Wa and make you be reborn.

00:02:46.020 --> 00:02:51.040
In the Box

00:02:49.780 --> 00:02:52.020
Please, open up!

00:02:59.360 --> 00:03:01.280
It's so bright.

00:03:02.430 --> 00:03:04.170
Open up!

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:17.800
Jeez, stop that racket!

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:21.780
Did I wake you?

00:03:25.590 --> 00:03:26.930
Where are we?

00:03:27.170 --> 00:03:30.060
We've been trapped in this shed.

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:32.810
To Rinne
Read this out loud

00:03:33.390 --> 00:03:35.670
Hey, Ageha, what's this?

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:39.300
"Read this out loud.

00:03:39.720 --> 00:03:40.820
To Rinne"

00:03:42.220 --> 00:03:47.080
I wonder if it's something Rokudou-kun's 
dad left for one of his creditors.

00:03:48.110 --> 00:03:50.030
It looks important.

00:03:50.030 --> 00:03:52.040
Maybe it'll be useful to Rokudou-kun.

00:03:52.390 --> 00:03:54.790
Okay, I'll open it.

00:03:54.790 --> 00:03:56.250
Ready, and...

00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:00.550
Are you okay?

00:04:01.210 --> 00:04:03.360
This box has a barrier on it.

00:04:05.110 --> 00:04:07.040
Seriously, shut up.

00:04:07.470 --> 00:04:08.600
You're both awake now.

00:04:15.450 --> 00:04:18.240
We need Rinne-sama to open this.

00:04:18.240 --> 00:04:18.860
What?

00:04:18.860 --> 00:04:23.860
To Rinne
Read this out loud

00:04:19.290 --> 00:04:23.860
There's something written in this 
space that only Rinne-sama can read.

00:04:24.080 --> 00:04:25.410
Can you explain?

00:04:25.830 --> 00:04:28.630
It's a contraption that makes sure

00:04:28.630 --> 00:04:31.870
weapons and stuff don't get 
into the hands of anyone else.

00:04:32.090 --> 00:04:33.740
"Weapons and stuff"?

00:04:33.740 --> 00:04:34.960
Let's go deliver it to him.

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:36.210
Rokudou-kun is outside.

00:04:36.690 --> 00:04:37.580
Outside?

00:04:37.790 --> 00:04:39.450
Hurry up and tell me where!

00:04:39.450 --> 00:04:40.760
Or else...

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:43.220
Ready, and...

00:04:48.210 --> 00:04:50.180
Mrowwwwrr.

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:52.680
Great, we're out.

00:04:53.200 --> 00:04:54.330
We have to hurry.

00:04:54.740 --> 00:04:55.940
Rinne's in trouble.

00:04:56.890 --> 00:05:01.690
Without his Life Flame, Rinne feels the 
full attraction of the Rinne no Wa.

00:05:01.980 --> 00:05:05.450
You said the moment he 
touches it, he'll be reborn.

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:08.040
Where is the Life Flame right now?

00:05:08.040 --> 00:05:09.870
We wouldn't have so much trouble if we knew.

00:05:10.420 --> 00:05:13.630
<i>Rinne's Life Flame was right here.</i>

00:05:13.630 --> 00:05:16.080
Oh, my. There's a huge hole in the shed.

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:18.470
It's going to cost a lot to repair.

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:26.930
Quit resisting and be reborn.

00:05:27.170 --> 00:05:28.640
That's not what we agreed on.

00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:33.700
You said you'd wait until the 
recycle shop opens at ten.

00:05:34.740 --> 00:05:40.260
I told you to find 
Damashigami Company by ten,

00:05:40.850 --> 00:05:43.890
but you lot don't seem to know where it is,

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:46.570
so I have no use for you.

00:05:46.860 --> 00:05:49.700
Seized

00:05:47.140 --> 00:05:49.700
I'm seizing your Haori 
of the Underworld again.

00:05:53.940 --> 00:05:54.910
More!

00:05:57.970 --> 00:06:00.440
<i>Rokudou Rinne has inhabited 
a temporary body by</i>

00:06:00.440 --> 00:06:03.190
<i>wearing the Haori of the 
Underworld inside-out,</i>

00:06:03.190 --> 00:06:06.090
<i>but if he loses the Haori, he'll 
once again become a spirit,</i>

00:06:06.090 --> 00:06:09.600
<i>leaving him vulnerable to the Rinne no 
Wa's attraction and to being reborn.</i>

00:06:17.570 --> 00:06:19.810
Rokudou-kun!

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:22.310
Rinne!

00:06:22.570 --> 00:06:24.270
Use this!

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:26.400
Isn't that...

00:06:27.120 --> 00:06:28.610
Here you go, Rinne.

00:06:30.050 --> 00:06:33.910
<i>It's the mystery box 
Grandma gave me long ago.</i>

00:06:36.640 --> 00:06:38.280
Dad!

00:06:45.020 --> 00:06:47.440
Give it back!

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:52.000
<i>Dad stole the box before I could open it.</i>

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:54.560
<i>I never found out what was in it.</i>

00:06:54.880 --> 00:06:56.180
Rokudou-kun.

00:06:56.850 --> 00:06:57.680
Move.

00:07:02.120 --> 00:07:03.230
Rokumon-chan!

00:07:04.110 --> 00:07:05.330
Rokudou-kun!

00:07:05.330 --> 00:07:06.900
Read the text on the box!

00:07:09.270 --> 00:07:10.870
<i>"Read this out loud"</i>

00:07:12.280 --> 00:07:13.250
<i>The text.</i>

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:21.180
"Elementary school entrance gift"!

00:07:25.110 --> 00:07:29.010
<i>In that moment, a grave 
disappointment filled the air.</i>

00:07:29.520 --> 00:07:32.430
<i>Elementary school entrance gift?</i>

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:34.630
<i>It might not be a weapon.</i>

00:07:35.240 --> 00:07:38.890
<i>I can't believe we brought this lame thing.</i>

00:07:46.950 --> 00:07:48.980
It's a hoop.

00:07:52.070 --> 00:07:54.240
Mrrrowowror!

00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:56.440
Thanks, Rokumon-chan!

00:07:58.600 --> 00:07:59.890
Rinne-sama!

00:07:59.890 --> 00:08:02.040
I'm coming with the hoop!

00:08:02.280 --> 00:08:05.570
So this <i>is</i> something good, 
right, Rokumon-chan?

00:08:05.570 --> 00:08:06.540
I dunno.

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:08.200
You don't?

00:08:08.200 --> 00:08:11.290
It was sealed for Rinne-sama.

00:08:11.290 --> 00:08:14.050
Rinne-sama would know how to use it.

00:08:14.470 --> 00:08:16.680
<i>No, she never told me.</i>

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:21.140
<i>Let's find out.</i>

00:08:20.640 --> 00:08:24.140
Seized

00:08:26.650 --> 00:08:27.690
The Haori!

00:08:34.970 --> 00:08:36.050
Rokudou-kun!

00:08:36.050 --> 00:08:37.780
Rinne-sama!

00:08:40.020 --> 00:08:42.660
Rokudou-kun, grab on!

00:08:42.660 --> 00:08:44.540
Mrowwrrr!

00:08:49.230 --> 00:08:51.550
Just a little closer.

00:08:53.060 --> 00:08:54.200
Grab it!

00:09:03.810 --> 00:09:04.720
They're gone.

00:09:06.870 --> 00:09:07.830
Rinne.

00:09:08.360 --> 00:09:09.650
Mamiya-san.

00:09:10.180 --> 00:09:13.030
They got absorbed into the Rinne no Wa.

00:09:36.110 --> 00:09:37.160
<i>Where am I?</i>

00:09:38.740 --> 00:09:40.610
<i>Right, I remember.</i>

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:42.970
<i>I got sucked towards the Rinne no Wa.</i>

00:09:45.860 --> 00:09:46.610
<i>Right.</i>

00:09:46.610 --> 00:09:47.720
<i>Mamiya Sakura.</i>

00:09:53.010 --> 00:09:53.980
<i>She's right here.</i>

00:09:55.010 --> 00:09:56.660
<i>N-No way.</i>

00:09:57.290 --> 00:09:59.870
<i>Did I bring her with me into the Rinne no Wa?</i>

00:10:00.390 --> 00:10:04.030
<i>If I did, she's going to be reborn, too.</i>

00:10:07.400 --> 00:10:09.130
Kain, you...

00:10:09.130 --> 00:10:10.340
How could you?!

00:10:10.340 --> 00:10:11.540
Mamiya-san, too!

00:10:13.210 --> 00:10:17.990
If that human girl got absorbed into 
the Rinne no Wa along with him,

00:10:17.990 --> 00:10:19.890
I won't be let off the hook either.

00:10:20.400 --> 00:10:23.870
It's a grave policy violation 
to force a human to be reborn

00:10:23.870 --> 00:10:26.220
while they still have plenty of time.

00:10:26.220 --> 00:10:28.900
How can you be so calm 
about it, you bastard?!

00:10:28.900 --> 00:10:29.990
Calm down.

00:10:31.150 --> 00:10:33.560
What he had was probably a Hoop of Judgment.

00:10:33.560 --> 00:10:34.900
Hoop of Judgment?

00:10:34.900 --> 00:10:38.880
Yes, I've read about it in 
the Shirushigami Library.

00:10:39.640 --> 00:10:44.390
The Hoop of Judgment is a legendary 
Shinigami tool that brings its bearer

00:10:44.830 --> 00:10:46.680
to the criminal of their wish.

00:10:47.700 --> 00:10:49.790
A criminal of their wish?

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:51.010
Yeah.

00:10:51.010 --> 00:10:56.780
So they must have traveled through 
space to the root of all the crimes:

00:10:56.780 --> 00:11:00.940
Rokudou Sabato's company, 
Damashigami Company.

00:11:03.100 --> 00:11:04.100
Sir...

00:11:05.640 --> 00:11:07.120
Excuse me.

00:11:07.120 --> 00:11:09.010
About our bottom line this month...

00:11:09.010 --> 00:11:10.680
We're in the red again.

00:11:12.350 --> 00:11:13.250
Huh?

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:20.610
I'm so sorry, Mamiya Sakura.

00:11:20.920 --> 00:11:24.110
This is all my fault!

00:11:24.820 --> 00:11:27.450
I'll make up for this in the next life!

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:28.330
I promise!

00:11:31.310 --> 00:11:32.230
Huh?

00:11:32.230 --> 00:11:33.830
What's wrong, Rokudou-kun?

00:11:34.130 --> 00:11:35.270
Mamiya Sakura.

00:11:36.130 --> 00:11:37.700
I have sad news.

00:11:39.150 --> 00:11:40.340
We've been...

00:11:40.570 --> 00:11:43.090
What? No.

00:11:45.230 --> 00:11:47.350
Are we in...

00:11:47.910 --> 00:11:48.850
Yeah.

00:11:50.890 --> 00:11:54.490
I'm sorry you came all this way...

00:11:57.970 --> 00:12:00.330
But our power's out.

00:12:00.330 --> 00:12:01.950
Huh...

00:12:01.950 --> 00:12:03.150
Why? What happened?

00:12:03.150 --> 00:12:03.920
¿Por qué?

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:08.450
Isn't this Kain's house?

00:12:08.720 --> 00:12:12.930
I don't know, but we're 
really poor for some reason.

00:12:13.730 --> 00:12:16.250
I know, I have an idea.

00:12:16.810 --> 00:12:20.380
Let's sell this Life Flame—

00:12:24.680 --> 00:12:26.100
An evil spirit!

00:12:26.100 --> 00:12:27.010
It's me.

00:12:27.650 --> 00:12:30.270
Which means this Life Flame is...

00:12:30.560 --> 00:12:31.770
Mine.

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:34.850
It's been seized for your debts.

00:12:35.380 --> 00:12:38.040
All because he co-signed it?

00:12:38.040 --> 00:12:39.520
You forged it!

00:12:41.450 --> 00:12:44.410
Rinne better be at the Company.

00:12:44.410 --> 00:12:45.260
Stop asking.

00:12:45.260 --> 00:12:48.030
You better not be talking out of your ass!

00:12:51.210 --> 00:12:53.290
Oh, welcome home, Kain.

00:12:53.290 --> 00:12:55.370
Thanks for having us.

00:12:55.710 --> 00:12:56.900
Rinne.

00:12:56.900 --> 00:12:57.820
Mamiya-san!

00:12:57.820 --> 00:12:59.000
You're safe!

00:12:59.250 --> 00:13:02.120
Kain-kun!

00:13:02.120 --> 00:13:04.800
You've gotten so big!

00:13:04.800 --> 00:13:05.700
Ow...

00:13:05.700 --> 00:13:06.760
You...

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:08.730
Don't be violent, Kain.

00:13:08.730 --> 00:13:10.170
Sabato-san's just...

00:13:10.760 --> 00:13:13.450
Here to borrow money.

00:13:13.450 --> 00:13:15.590
Here I am.

00:13:18.500 --> 00:13:20.230
Oh? Who could it be?

00:13:20.980 --> 00:13:22.240
Excuse me.

00:13:22.240 --> 00:13:23.330
My.

00:13:23.330 --> 00:13:24.760
Who might you be?

00:13:24.760 --> 00:13:26.980
There you are.

00:13:26.980 --> 00:13:29.060
I looked for you.

00:13:29.060 --> 00:13:30.200
Let's go.

00:13:31.300 --> 00:13:33.530
Sabato-san, who is she?

00:13:33.530 --> 00:13:35.090
My sister.

00:13:36.680 --> 00:13:41.090
I was recently reunited 
with my long-lost sister.

00:13:41.090 --> 00:13:43.840
And that's why I need money.

00:13:44.100 --> 00:13:46.970
My, that's serious!

00:13:46.970 --> 00:13:48.550
How could you?!

00:13:49.240 --> 00:13:50.390
Careful!

00:13:52.450 --> 00:13:54.370
No violence, Kain.

00:13:54.370 --> 00:13:56.850
You're being rude to Sabato-san's sister.

00:13:58.000 --> 00:14:00.450
Onii-chan.

00:14:00.450 --> 00:14:02.860
Sister!

00:14:04.050 --> 00:14:05.360
Onee-chan!

00:14:06.880 --> 00:14:10.470
What the hell are you doing here?

00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:12.580
Onee-chan?

00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:15.620
Staaaaaaaaare.

00:14:13.480 --> 00:14:15.620
My sister's sister.

00:14:18.730 --> 00:14:22.630
It's all very complicated.

00:14:22.900 --> 00:14:25.380
My, poor you.

00:14:28.870 --> 00:14:30.470
You're not having it back yet!

00:14:32.640 --> 00:14:33.760
The hoop.

00:14:33.760 --> 00:14:35.180
It deflected it.

00:14:35.180 --> 00:14:38.220
It's the Shield of Justice feature 
of the legendary Shinigami tool,

00:14:38.220 --> 00:14:40.510
the Hoop of Judgment!

00:14:40.510 --> 00:14:42.060
Shield of Justice?

00:14:46.080 --> 00:14:48.700
<i>The Hoop of Judgment protected me.</i>

00:14:50.260 --> 00:14:52.450
My, it's gone dark.

00:14:52.750 --> 00:14:55.850
He managed to get his Life Flame back?

00:14:55.850 --> 00:14:57.750
Over there.

00:14:58.290 --> 00:14:59.730
Up we go.

00:14:58.290 --> 00:14:59.730
Sneaky-sneak, sneak.

00:14:59.730 --> 00:15:00.960
Hey, you!

00:15:09.060 --> 00:15:10.590
She got us.

00:15:11.060 --> 00:15:12.340
No you don't!

00:15:12.340 --> 00:15:19.810
For a Happy Japan
 I'll never give up politics

00:15:15.610 --> 00:15:16.800
They're not here.

00:15:16.800 --> 00:15:18.190
Where are they?

00:15:25.650 --> 00:15:26.900
Whoosh!

00:15:32.700 --> 00:15:35.940
Do you think you're going to sell 
it off to the recycle shop directly?

00:15:37.480 --> 00:15:41.330
Sadly for you, that Life Flame is a fake.

00:15:41.660 --> 00:15:42.960
Say what?

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:47.090
I had a dummy prepared just in case.

00:15:51.340 --> 00:15:53.510
Switch

00:15:52.370 --> 00:15:53.510
Switch.

00:15:54.070 --> 00:15:55.190
Boopies.

00:15:55.190 --> 00:15:56.260
It turned off.

00:15:56.260 --> 00:15:58.100
Whoa, cool.

00:15:58.100 --> 00:16:09.480
Life Flame Look-alike

00:15:58.620 --> 00:16:02.390
<i>This is the Life Flame Look-alike, 
a Shinigami tool available</i>

00:16:02.390 --> 00:16:04.510
<i>at the Afterlife Dollar Store.</i>

00:16:04.510 --> 00:16:09.480
<i>Highly recommended for when your 
Life Flame is being targeted.</i>

00:16:10.290 --> 00:16:11.360
There they are!

00:16:14.710 --> 00:16:16.710
Where's the real one?

00:16:16.710 --> 00:16:19.020
It's collateral. It's important.

00:16:19.020 --> 00:16:20.750
I hid it elsewhere.

00:16:22.030 --> 00:16:24.350
It must be somewhere at the house.

00:16:25.320 --> 00:16:26.630
For example...

00:16:27.190 --> 00:16:28.840
In that shed from earlier.

00:16:38.390 --> 00:16:39.420
Rinne.

00:16:41.250 --> 00:16:42.530
Use this.

00:16:50.090 --> 00:16:51.190
Now's our chance.

00:16:57.050 --> 00:16:58.400
I can't find it.

00:16:59.220 --> 00:17:00.160
I found it.

00:17:00.650 --> 00:17:01.660
Here.

00:17:01.660 --> 00:17:02.790
I found it.

00:17:06.120 --> 00:17:07.790
What the heck is this?

00:17:08.020 --> 00:17:10.020
Which one's the real one?

00:17:10.790 --> 00:17:15.520
One of them might be the real one, 
or it might not even be here.

00:17:15.520 --> 00:17:17.800
Oh, I have an idea.

00:17:21.130 --> 00:17:23.180
Do you not intend to give 
me back my Life Flame?

00:17:23.430 --> 00:17:26.170
As your creditor, I have the right not to.

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:31.320
Unagi

00:17:28.080 --> 00:17:31.320
Aiyah! Premium unagi lunch 
sets for nine, lah~!

00:17:31.530 --> 00:17:33.680
Put it on my tab, please.

00:17:33.680 --> 00:17:36.050
My favorite!

00:17:36.690 --> 00:17:38.160
It smells delicious.

00:17:41.130 --> 00:17:42.160
Dude!

00:17:46.080 --> 00:17:47.800
Come on!

00:17:49.270 --> 00:17:50.820
Rinne, we're back.

00:17:50.820 --> 00:17:52.590
We found your Life Flame.

00:17:56.340 --> 00:17:58.590
If it's the right one, it 
should go in your body.

00:17:58.940 --> 00:17:59.510
Here.

00:17:59.510 --> 00:18:00.730
Hit it!

00:18:00.730 --> 00:18:01.160
Here.

00:18:01.160 --> 00:18:02.320
Hit it!

00:18:02.320 --> 00:18:02.830
Here.

00:18:02.830 --> 00:18:04.020
Hit it!

00:18:08.390 --> 00:18:10.400
Seriously, are you even trying?

00:18:11.140 --> 00:18:12.100
No way.

00:18:12.100 --> 00:18:14.280
They're all duds!

00:18:14.540 --> 00:18:17.830
Now, now, everyone. Let's all calm down.

00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:19.410
Eat up.

00:18:19.410 --> 00:18:22.240
Are you sure? You don't even have power.

00:18:23.010 --> 00:18:24.870
That was delicious.

00:18:25.140 --> 00:18:27.720
I feel like having dessert.

00:18:27.720 --> 00:18:29.870
Melon would be nice.

00:18:30.890 --> 00:18:32.880
I can't believe any of you.

00:18:35.480 --> 00:18:37.730
Shoot, I can't eat!

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:41.690
<i>Since Rokudou Rinne is 
a spirit at the moment,</i>

00:18:41.690 --> 00:18:45.560
<i>he can't eat without wearing his 
Haori of the Underworld inside-out.</i>

00:18:46.280 --> 00:18:47.490
My unagi lunch!

00:18:48.410 --> 00:18:51.490
<i>Meanwhile, Rokudou Rinne's body was having</i>

00:18:55.570 --> 00:18:58.530
<i>a sorry time indeed.</i>

00:18:59.240 --> 00:19:01.320
I'm having chills.

00:19:01.320 --> 00:19:03.010
Of course you would.

00:19:03.010 --> 00:19:05.660
You left your body in the living world.

00:19:05.940 --> 00:19:11.180
I'm sorry, I can't turn on the air 
conditioner because we don't have power.

00:19:11.180 --> 00:19:13.630
Oh, but we do have a fireplace.

00:19:13.630 --> 00:19:14.540
You can warm up there.

00:19:18.210 --> 00:19:22.380
Where's the real Life Flame, though?

00:19:25.050 --> 00:19:26.140
Found it!

00:19:32.930 --> 00:19:34.440
Is it back?

00:19:37.530 --> 00:19:40.360
Thank goodness, Rinne!

00:19:42.330 --> 00:19:45.190
<i>Rinne may have gotten his Life Flame back,</i>

00:19:45.190 --> 00:19:47.540
<i>but he's left his body in the living world.</i>

00:19:48.810 --> 00:19:50.960
The Hoop of Judgment? Why?

00:19:51.220 --> 00:19:54.030
The Hoop of Judgment's 
Shield of Justice feature

00:19:54.030 --> 00:19:57.490
is activated when the user 
is attacked unjustly.

00:19:57.490 --> 00:19:58.610
Unjustly?

00:19:59.330 --> 00:20:04.900
He may be a cosigner, but taking his 
Life Flame is clearly going too far.

00:20:05.350 --> 00:20:06.760
Cool your head.

00:20:06.760 --> 00:20:10.730
Since when were you one 
to talk, you parasite dad?

00:20:10.730 --> 00:20:14.980
The injustice is that you made him 
a cosigner using a forged seal.

00:20:14.980 --> 00:20:16.480
Rokudou Sabato!

00:20:16.730 --> 00:20:18.480
You're busted!

00:20:18.480 --> 00:20:19.480
Kain!

00:20:19.720 --> 00:20:22.930
I've kept quiet because I didn't 
want my mother to be hurt.

00:20:23.610 --> 00:20:25.280
But enough is enough.

00:20:25.280 --> 00:20:28.700
I, Rokudou Sabato, take you, 
Damashigami Company President—

00:20:28.700 --> 00:20:31.810
Premium quality melon delivery.

00:20:31.810 --> 00:20:33.500
Put it on my tab, please.

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:34.830
Melon

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:34.830
Dude!

00:20:36.330 --> 00:20:38.370
Wee!

00:20:36.600 --> 00:20:38.370
They're getting away!

00:20:38.370 --> 00:20:39.800
Wait up!

00:20:44.180 --> 00:20:46.500
They're gone.

00:20:46.500 --> 00:20:48.390
They're so quick to escape.

00:20:57.490 --> 00:21:01.850
Pretending to have run outside, 
only to return to steal valuables.

00:21:03.650 --> 00:21:05.120
Crap, Rinne.

00:21:05.120 --> 00:21:07.530
I know your behavior patterns 
through and through, Dad.

00:21:08.290 --> 00:21:09.410
You're not getting away.

00:21:16.260 --> 00:21:17.790
<i>The Hoop of Judgment.</i>

00:21:24.150 --> 00:21:25.570
The hoop closed on them.

00:21:25.570 --> 00:21:27.050
It even has an arrest feature.

00:21:32.370 --> 00:21:33.560
They got away.

00:21:33.810 --> 00:21:38.190
Rokudou-kun is a victim of his father, too. 
Do you get that now?

00:21:38.450 --> 00:21:41.930
Don't take his Life Flame from him anymore.

00:21:44.730 --> 00:21:45.950
I can't anymore.

00:21:46.230 --> 00:21:49.090
Not as long as he's protected 
by the Hoop of Judgment.

00:21:49.820 --> 00:21:52.630
But keep this in mind, Rokudou Rinne:

00:21:52.630 --> 00:21:55.010
so long as you're Rokudou Sabato's son,

00:21:55.010 --> 00:21:56.960
as far as I'm concerned, 
you're equally guilty.

00:21:57.290 --> 00:21:59.770
Sabato-san went home.

00:21:59.770 --> 00:22:01.090
Too bad.

00:22:01.350 --> 00:22:05.590
Eat well for his part, too, everyone.

00:22:05.590 --> 00:22:08.680
Are you sure? You don't even have power.

00:22:08.680 --> 00:22:12.150
I'm pretty sure his Mom's part 
of the reason they're poor.

00:22:12.150 --> 00:22:13.180
Yum!

00:22:13.180 --> 00:22:15.220
Come on!

00:22:17.680 --> 00:22:19.230
<i>And later...</i>

00:22:20.870 --> 00:22:24.890
Dammit, Dad. He put a security lock on it.

00:22:25.320 --> 00:22:30.990
<i>The Hoop of Judgment would never 
take them to Damashigami Company.</i>

00:24:01.040 --> 00:24:25.980
Next Episode:
A Home Without Spirits

00:24:02.060 --> 00:24:05.910
What does one wear when 
going to a woman's room?

00:24:05.910 --> 00:24:08.970
Dressing casually may be a 
good way to appear friendly,

00:24:08.970 --> 00:24:10.340
but you don't want to come across too loose.

00:24:10.340 --> 00:24:12.230
Should I dress formally?

00:24:12.230 --> 00:24:14.230
Either way, I need to bring a gift.

00:24:14.230 --> 00:24:16.970
A box of sweets would be too ceremonious, 
and it wouldn't be good if she's on a diet.

00:24:17.220 --> 00:24:18.760
I shall bring a bouquet of flowers.

00:24:18.760 --> 00:24:22.040
Next time on <i>Rin-ne</i>:
"A Home Without Spirits."

00:24:22.040 --> 00:24:25.460
With heartfelt red roses, I move out!
